      'When we repair a home gate in McKinney, safety comes first. We check that photo eyes, edges and reversing work properly, because an automatic gate needs to stop and reverse if a child, pet or car is in its path. On pedestrian and side gates, we fix sagging hinges and latches so the gate closes and holds, which matters for pools and dogs. Then we repair the opener, battery or wiring. Hinge, latch and sensor work fixes many of these calls.',
